      "formula": "(\\mathsf{P}f)(x,y)\\coloneqq\\int f(x^{\\prime},y)\\,\\pi_{\\eta}^{X\\mid Y=y}(\\mathrm{d}x^{\\prime})=\\mathbb{E}[f(X,Y)\\mid Y=y]\\,.",
